    <h2>Overview</h2>
    <p>Landrace Cannabis Co. operates an adult-use cannabis dispensary in the Sebago Lakes Region at 325 Roosevelt Trail, Casco, ME 04015. The name "Landrace" is a botanical term for cannabis strains that have developed naturally in a specific region over many generations — a nod to the operator's positioning around heritage and craft genetics rather than the latest designer crosses.</p>
    <p>Roosevelt Trail (Route 302) is the primary commercial corridor through the Sebago Lakes Region, running from Portland / Windham through Raymond, Casco, Otisfield, and into Bridgton and Fryeburg. The Landrace Casco location is well-positioned to serve the year-round Lakes Region community as well as the significant summer tourism traffic to Sebago Lake and the surrounding recreational areas.</p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Casco Location</h2>
    <p><strong>Address:</strong> 325 Roosevelt Trail, Casco, ME 04015<br>
    <strong>Highway access:</strong> Route 302 / Roosevelt Trail, the main east-west corridor through the Sebago Lakes Region.</p>
    <p>Casco is a small Cumberland County town on the north shore of Sebago Lake. The town's commercial district runs along Roosevelt Trail, with a mix of year-round businesses and summer-season operators serving the lake community. Landrace Cannabis Co. is one of at least two dispensaries in town — Blue Lobster Cannabis is the other, also on Route 302.</p>
    <p>Parking is on-site at the storefront. Hours and contact details should be confirmed with the operator before visiting.</p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Online Ordering</h2>
    <p>Landrace Cannabis Co. supports online ordering for the Casco location through their website. The operator's portal at <a href="https://www.landracecanna.com/casco-order-online" data-cta-id="cta-referral-landrace-casco-menu" data-action-id="referral-landrace-casco-menu" data-action-family="cta_navigate" data-placement-id="operator_profile" data-referral-kind="dispensary" data-partner-id="landrace-cannabis-casco" data-referral-surface="operator_profile">landracecanna.com/casco-order-online</a> allows customers to browse the menu and place orders for pickup.</p>
    <p>Maine has no standalone cannabis courier license. Confirm directly whether Landrace offers delivery to your address and which authorized medical registrant or adult-use licensee is responsible for the order.</p>
  </section>

